<title>FINLAND: OLVI BUYS 15 PCT IN ESTONIAN BREWERY.</title>
<headline>OLVI BUYS 15 PCT IN ESTONIAN BREWERY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish drinks company Olvi Oy said in a statement on Monday it had acquired a 15 percent stake in Estonian brewery Tartu Olletehas for 3.6 million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;Cooperation of Olvi and Tartu Olletehas started already in June 1996, when exports of Olvi's beer and long drinks to Estonian market was started,&quot; Olvi said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0247</p>
</text>
